cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MOBIUS-RQA — memory-echo governance for assistants with memory"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Toeda
    given-names: Taiko
    affiliation: MOBIUS LLC
abstract: >-
  A working, model-independent, near-deterministic mitigation for "memory
  echo" in LLM assistants with long-term memory: provenance-tagged memory
  plus deterministic output-time self-citation verification, with an
  empirical pilot across six local models in three families.
repository-code: "https://github.com/mobius-style/rqa"
url: "https://github.com/mobius-style/rqa"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - ai-memory
  - provenance
  - memory-echo
  - self-citation-verification
  - local-first
